1
00:01:32,729 --> 00:01:34,950
[OVERDO]

2
00:01:35,289 --> 00:01:37,759
[Episode 20]

3
00:01:57,039 --> 00:01:58,039
Uncle Fang,

4
00:01:59,150 --> 00:02:00,680
why the rush to leave?

5
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,650
Back to "Uncle Fang" again?

6
00:02:05,510 --> 00:02:08,110
You switch back
the moment outsiders are gone.

7
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:11,960
Why are you always so hung up on that?

8
00:02:13,590 --> 00:02:14,590
You silly girl,

9
00:02:15,470 --> 00:02:17,630
you call me so sweetly
in front of everyone,

10
00:02:17,630 --> 00:02:20,400
but in private, you're too shy to do it.

11
00:02:22,310 --> 00:02:23,120
Child,

12
00:02:24,030 --> 00:02:25,090
never forget this—

13
00:02:26,030 --> 00:02:27,310
you'll always be

14
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:29,680
my own daughter.

15
00:02:32,710 --> 00:02:33,910
I was hoping

16
00:02:34,030 --> 00:02:35,630
to show you more of Nancheng.

17
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:38,870
There'll be plenty of chances
in the future.

18
00:02:38,870 --> 00:02:40,520
I'm hurrying back this time

19
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:43,560
because I want to tell Mulan myself,

20
00:02:43,710 --> 00:02:45,120
at her grave,

21
00:02:46,590 --> 00:02:48,720
that her vengeance has been fulfilled

22
00:02:48,870 --> 00:02:50,730
and that she can rest in peace now.

23
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,360
Besides,

24
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,360
I received a telegram from Nanyang

25
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:59,240
saying something went wrong
with one of the Li family's shipments.

26
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:01,440
I must go back and handle it personally.

27
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,310
Is there anything I can help with?

28
00:03:03,310 --> 00:03:04,750
Don't worry about that.

29
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:05,560
You

30
00:03:05,910 --> 00:03:08,000
just stay in Nancheng

31
00:03:08,150 --> 00:03:09,680
and wait for me to come back.

32
00:03:11,870 --> 00:03:12,600
Master Fang.

33
00:03:14,430 --> 00:03:15,080
Laiyi,

34
00:03:15,630 --> 00:03:16,560
why are you here?

35
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,680
Young Master Qingyi is now in Hangcheng.

36
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:20,750
He's heard
that you're rushing back to Nanyang,

37
00:03:20,750 --> 00:03:23,810
so he's sent me to deliver a gift
on his behalf, Mr. Fang.

38
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:27,280
During the confiscation
of the Huo family's assets,

39
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:30,150
Young Master Qingyi found a stack of
old photos at the orphanage,

40
00:03:30,150 --> 00:03:31,680
and this one was among them.

41
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,310
This photo,

42
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:17,410
along with those of other murdered girls,

43
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:20,570
was hidden deep
within the Huo residence.

44
00:04:21,269 --> 00:04:22,120
Each was labeled

45
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:24,380
with the victim's true age and identity.

46
00:04:29,750 --> 00:04:31,480
She looks just like her mother.

47
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:35,070
Especially the eyes.

48
00:04:38,270 --> 00:04:39,750
She's just skinny.

49
00:04:42,159 --> 00:04:43,720
Too skinny.

50
00:05:00,510 --> 00:05:02,000
I never imagined I'd live

51
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:07,240
to see what she'd look like all grown up.

52
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:16,660
Thank Young Master Qingyi for me.

53
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,490
I will, Master Fang.

54
00:05:19,870 --> 00:05:20,680
Miss Fang,

55
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:24,450
I'll be heading to Hangcheng
to pick up Young Master Qingyi.

56
00:05:41,310 --> 00:05:42,600
I can tell.

57
00:05:43,510 --> 00:05:44,480
Your heart

58
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:46,840
belongs to Young Master Qingyi.

59
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:50,180
Since that's the case,

60
00:05:50,510 --> 00:05:52,360
your engagement to Murong Qingyu

61
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:53,560
is off.

62
00:05:58,680 --> 00:06:00,010
I still remember the day

63
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:03,360
you came to Nanyang,

64
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:06,180
[Nanyang Wharf]

65
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:07,560
traveling all that way with Mulan's ashes.

66
00:06:10,900 --> 00:06:14,890
[Nanyang Wharf]

67
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:13,160
I told you then

68
00:06:13,310 --> 00:06:15,640
that you'd escaped that sea of suffering,

69
00:06:16,070 --> 00:06:17,730
so you should let go of the past

70
00:06:19,190 --> 00:06:21,120
and live your own life.

71
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:25,430
But you said...

72
00:06:25,630 --> 00:06:26,560
I said...

73
00:06:27,310 --> 00:06:29,310
As long as the Huo family still exists,

74
00:06:29,310 --> 00:06:30,360
I'll be trapped
in that sea of suffering...

75
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:32,720
I'd be trapped
in that sea of suffering forever,

76
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:33,980
with no shore in sight.

77
00:06:38,750 --> 00:06:39,680
My dear child,

78
00:06:41,430 --> 00:06:43,510
you've reached the shore now.

79
00:06:44,510 --> 00:06:45,560
Forget the past

80
00:06:47,430 --> 00:06:49,240
and start your life anew.

81
00:06:53,870 --> 00:06:56,920
Once I finish
handling the business in Nanyang,

82
00:06:57,390 --> 00:06:58,190
I'll come back

83
00:06:58,630 --> 00:07:00,270
and personally arrange

84
00:07:00,750 --> 00:07:02,480
your wedding with that boy.

85
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:07,090
I'd like to become a grandfather
as soon as possible.

86
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:13,920
Alright.

87
00:07:15,070 --> 00:07:15,930
Enough of that.

88
00:07:17,070 --> 00:07:18,130
I'll get going now.

89
00:07:48,190 --> 00:07:48,950
Boze,

90
00:07:49,159 --> 00:07:49,600
it's me.

91
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:50,159
Qingyu,

92
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:51,480
what's wrong?

93
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,750
Did something happen at home?

94
00:07:53,750 --> 00:07:55,190
I just missed you.

95
00:07:55,430 --> 00:07:57,360
What could possibly happen at home?

96
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,690
Everyone's doing fine.

97
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:00,780
Then why are you...

98
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:03,520
I was thinking of
asking you out for a drink.

99
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:06,320
Then I remembered you're in Hangcheng now.

100
00:08:07,390 --> 00:08:08,790
I'll be back in a few days.

101
00:08:09,070 --> 00:08:10,000
When I come back,

102
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,820
let's go to Yanxi Restaurant.

103
00:08:11,950 --> 00:08:13,630
The owner there and I go way back.

104
00:08:13,630 --> 00:08:15,800
He's been saving an 18-year-old Nu'er Hong
just for me.

105
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,530
You can't get it anywhere else.

106
00:08:19,630 --> 00:08:20,360
Okay.

107
00:08:20,630 --> 00:08:21,720
The two of us will

108
00:08:21,870 --> 00:08:22,950
drink until we drop that day.

109
00:08:22,950 --> 00:08:23,600
Deal.

110
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,360
Just...

111
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:27,480
don't let Father Li find out

112
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:29,280
I've been hiding that rice wine.

113
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:31,390
Otherwise, if he learns I've been keeping
good wine from him,

114
00:08:31,390 --> 00:08:33,120
he'll definitely get mad at me.

115
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,640
But for you, Brother,

116
00:08:35,030 --> 00:08:36,960
I'm willing to be a bad son for once.

117
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,080
Qingyu?

118
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:47,300
I'm still here.

119
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:51,030
Boze.

120
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,640
Let me ask you something.

121
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,670
I mean, suppose.

122
00:08:58,750 --> 00:08:59,750
Suppose one day

123
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:04,450
the Murong family and the Li family
end up on opposing sides.

124
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,360
What would you do?

125
00:09:10,670 --> 00:09:11,480
Qingyu,

126
00:09:12,870 --> 00:09:14,200
what do you mean by that?

127
00:09:17,630 --> 00:09:18,750
Times change.

128
00:09:19,030 --> 00:09:20,560
Who can say what may happen?

129
00:09:20,630 --> 00:09:22,390
I mean, just suppose it happened.

130
00:09:22,390 --> 00:09:23,650
That'll never happen.

131
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:25,720
And you would never let that happen,

132
00:09:26,150 --> 00:09:26,720
right?

133
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,240
Brother,

134
00:09:31,510 --> 00:09:33,150
you promised me, remember?

135
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,000
When I left home

136
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,030
at 8 years old,

137
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,440
you said

138
00:09:38,910 --> 00:09:40,440
nothing would ever change.

139
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,910
Of course I remember.

140
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:48,440
You'll always be my brother.

141
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,200
Boze,

142
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:56,630
remember this—

143
00:09:57,870 --> 00:10:00,270
the Murong family
will always be your home.

144
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,750
No matter what happens,

145
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:05,120
you can always come home.

146
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:06,840
Got it?

147
00:10:08,870 --> 00:10:09,670
I understand.

148
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:14,360
Okay.

149
00:10:15,630 --> 00:10:17,290
You go ahead and do your thing.

150
00:10:24,150 --> 00:10:25,240
Our wedding

151
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:28,630
will be your best chance
to assassinate Li Rongzhang.

152
00:10:28,630 --> 00:10:29,840
Only by dying

153
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:32,170
can I do what's best for Qingyi.

154
00:10:37,910 --> 00:10:38,750
Boze,

155
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:40,240
I'm sorry.

156
00:10:41,510 --> 00:10:43,970
If there truly is retribution
in this world,

157
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:45,960
let it all fall upon me.

158
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:04,670
It's snowing.

159
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:06,080
-It's snowing.
-It's snowing!

160
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:07,320
Look, it's snowing!

161
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:08,600
-It's actually snowing.
-It's snowing.

162
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:09,720
It's so lovely.

163
00:11:10,630 --> 00:11:11,120
Look.

164
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,180
It's so beautiful.

165
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:14,720
It's snowing so heavily.

166
00:11:14,910 --> 00:11:16,390
It's so beautiful.

167
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:17,870
So lovely.

168
00:11:23,790 --> 00:11:25,630
Can you just give me one second?

169
00:11:29,270 --> 00:11:30,800
Just love me for one second.

170
00:11:37,150 --> 00:11:39,240
I'll be back before the first snow.

171
00:11:40,270 --> 00:11:40,910
P.S.

172
00:11:41,910 --> 00:11:43,710
Contact me if you need anything.

173
00:11:44,270 --> 00:11:45,080
P.P.S.

174
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:47,860
Contact me even just to say hi.

175
00:12:03,670 --> 00:12:05,200
Why are you panting so hard?

176
00:12:09,510 --> 00:12:10,630
I was just running.

177
00:12:11,870 --> 00:12:12,670
What's wrong?

178
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:14,150
Missed me?

179
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:19,480
Thank you for the photo.

180
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:21,390
Uncle Fang...

181
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,150
was very happy.

182
00:12:24,870 --> 00:12:26,080
It was nothing.

183
00:12:27,390 --> 00:12:29,390
I took care of the Huo family for you.

184
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,150
From now on,

185
00:12:31,550 --> 00:12:33,080
you'll never again have to

186
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:35,000
carry the pain of the past with you,

187
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:36,730
unable to eat or sleep in peace.

188
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:39,600
Whatever happens

189
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:40,870
in the future,

190
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,480
you can tell me.

191
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:44,290
I can help you handle it.

192
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:58,360
Susu?

193
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:01,870
Susu!

194
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:11,200
It's snowing.

195
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:13,390
Right now?

196
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:15,690
I can't see it from here.

197
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:18,240
Hold on.

198
00:13:33,050 --> 00:13:34,920
♪ I happened to ♪

199
00:13:34,950 --> 00:13:37,020
♪ Hear your name ♪

200
00:13:38,010 --> 00:13:39,880
♪ And all the memories ♪

201
00:13:39,910 --> 00:13:43,160
♪ Came flooding back ♪

202
00:13:43,770 --> 00:13:45,630
♪ There I stood in the falling snow ♪

203
00:13:45,650 --> 00:13:48,120
♪ Wrapped in my coat ♪

204
00:13:48,710 --> 00:13:50,980
♪ My heart pounding ♪

205
00:13:53,260 --> 00:13:54,970
♪ Walking down that old road ♪

206
00:13:54,990 --> 00:13:56,790
♪ Stopping every few steps ♪

207
00:13:58,330 --> 00:13:59,970
♪ In the misty train car ♪

208
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:03,640
♪ I wish I could ask you once more ♪

209
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:03,600
Did you hear that?

210
00:14:04,620 --> 00:14:08,580
♪ If you have any ♪

211
00:14:08,630 --> 00:14:10,840
♪ New corny jokes to tell ♪

212
00:14:12,550 --> 00:14:13,360
Yes.

213
00:14:13,590 --> 00:14:16,440
♪ Memories are like falling into a trap ♪

214
00:14:14,670 --> 00:14:16,130
The sound of snow falling.

215
00:14:16,460 --> 00:14:18,710
♪ Full of mud ♪

216
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:18,280
It sounded just like your voice.

217
00:14:18,760 --> 00:14:20,920
♪ The more I struggle,
the more suffocated I become ♪

218
00:14:21,370 --> 00:14:24,120
♪ But I couldn't resist collecting them ♪

219
00:14:21,910 --> 00:14:23,170
Then what was I saying?

220
00:14:24,160 --> 00:14:26,530
♪ I keep collecting ♪

221
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:25,550
You were saying...

222
00:14:26,560 --> 00:14:29,390
♪ Every word and comment ♪

223
00:14:28,150 --> 00:14:29,150
you missed me.

224
00:14:29,410 --> 00:14:31,540
♪ They speak of you ♪

225
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:34,060
♪ You're becoming clear ♪

226
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:36,040
♪ So far yet so clear ♪

227
00:14:36,730 --> 00:14:39,200
♪ Ever since forgetting you ♪

228
00:14:39,220 --> 00:14:42,160
♪ Became second nature ♪

229
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:45,310
♪ I still can't erase ♪

230
00:14:45,270 --> 00:14:46,030
Qingyi.

231
00:14:45,330 --> 00:14:47,130
♪ Completely erase ♪

232
00:14:47,900 --> 00:14:51,910
♪ The certainty of my hand in yours ♪

233
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,600
If one day...

234
00:14:51,950 --> 00:14:54,500
♪ You are so clear ♪

235
00:14:54,520 --> 00:14:56,690
♪ So close and so clear ♪

236
00:14:55,750 --> 00:14:57,550
I wanted to let go of everything here

237
00:14:57,340 --> 00:14:59,460
♪ If you possibly ♪

238
00:14:59,390 --> 00:15:00,510
and leave forever...

239
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:01,760
♪ Still have the courage ♪

240
00:15:01,820 --> 00:15:06,380
♪ Then take me away from here ♪

241
00:15:05,270 --> 00:15:06,870
would you come with me?

242
00:15:08,310 --> 00:15:10,460
♪ Please stop doubting ♪

243
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:14,410
♪ My determination to run away with you ♪

244
00:15:17,010 --> 00:15:18,900
♪ Running toward you ♪

245
00:15:19,660 --> 00:15:21,670
♪ From the day I thought ♪

246
00:15:21,760 --> 00:15:24,720
♪ I succeeded in forgetting you ♪

247
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:26,250
Isn't that exactly
what I've been hoping for?

248
00:15:26,250 --> 00:15:28,140
♪ Facing the past ♪

249
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:28,120
Susu,

250
00:15:28,160 --> 00:15:30,720
♪ With you inside ♪

251
00:15:28,750 --> 00:15:29,910
from now on,

252
00:15:30,630 --> 00:15:31,910
whatever happens,

253
00:15:30,740 --> 00:15:32,560
♪ My resolve crumbles ♪

254
00:15:32,510 --> 00:15:33,750
you must tell me.

255
00:15:32,580 --> 00:15:34,780
♪ Immediately ♪

256
00:15:34,870 --> 00:15:37,320
♪ I'm running ♪

257
00:15:35,120 --> 00:15:36,980
I have the ability to protect you.

258
00:15:37,340 --> 00:15:39,350
♪ Running toward you ♪

259
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:38,840
Let's

260
00:15:39,970 --> 00:15:42,410
♪ No matter how much gossip there is ♪

261
00:15:40,390 --> 00:15:41,750
never be apart again,

262
00:15:42,150 --> 00:15:43,000
okay?

263
00:15:42,430 --> 00:15:44,560
♪ I have the courage ♪

264
00:15:44,580 --> 00:15:50,200
♪ I know you're not far away ♪

265
00:15:51,140 --> 00:15:53,620
♪ Having loved you deeply ♪

266
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:57,190
♪ Was the best decision I've made ♪

267
00:16:20,010 --> 00:16:23,190
[Several Days Later ·
Somewhere in the South China Sea]

268
00:16:42,150 --> 00:16:43,910
The Li family's shipment...

269
00:16:47,030 --> 00:16:48,320
I see.

270
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:52,120
Master, we can't
hold them off much longer.

271
00:16:57,440 --> 00:16:58,150
Alright.

272
00:16:59,910 --> 00:17:01,550
You've followed me

273
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:04,000
across the seas,

274
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:05,440
far from home.

275
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:07,750
But

276
00:17:09,510 --> 00:17:11,270
I can't take you back.

277
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:13,510
I, Fang Youshen,

278
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:15,810
have failed you all.

279
00:17:16,510 --> 00:17:17,069
Master Fang.

280
00:17:17,069 --> 00:17:17,880
Master.

281
00:17:25,750 --> 00:17:26,510
Mulan,

282
00:17:27,310 --> 00:17:28,710
Dad is coming to join you.

283
00:18:15,350 --> 00:18:17,080
Madam, something's happened!

284
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:21,000
It's early in the morning.
Have you no regard for taboos?

285
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:21,750
What is it?

286
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:28,400
Give it to me.

287
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:38,790
What happened?

288
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:46,560
What's wrong, Mrs. Wang?

289
00:18:46,920 --> 00:18:47,880
The Fang family's cargo ship

290
00:18:47,050 --> 00:18:48,950
[Fang Family Cargo Ship Explodes at Sea]

291
00:18:47,880 --> 00:18:49,830
caught fire
while sailing through Nanyang waters

292
00:18:48,980 --> 00:18:53,420
[Nanyang's Wealthiest Merchant
Fang Youshen Dies in Disaster]

293
00:18:50,270 --> 00:18:51,930
and exploded before sinking.

294
00:18:59,310 --> 00:19:00,160
This can't be.

295
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:06,800
Notify Qingyu immediately.

296
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:15,220
Let's get married—

297
00:19:15,400 --> 00:19:16,730
the sooner, the better.

298
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:21,790
In four days,

299
00:19:21,920 --> 00:19:22,980
it'll be the ninth.

300
00:19:23,240 --> 00:19:25,300
It's an auspicious day for weddings.

301
00:19:26,310 --> 00:19:28,510
I won't let him leave the wedding alive.

302
00:19:29,590 --> 00:19:31,000
This is your own choice.

303
00:19:32,830 --> 00:19:33,960
Actually, you could also choose...

304
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:36,090
Have someone else take revenge for me?

305
00:19:36,400 --> 00:19:38,660
I promised not to implicate your family,

306
00:19:38,960 --> 00:19:42,090
and I won't let my sisters
risk their lives for me either.

307
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:45,370
But we need to come up with a plan
to use a stand-in.

308
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:48,200
I understand.

309
00:19:49,350 --> 00:19:50,550
During the ceremony,

310
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:53,460
both the bride and the groom
must be present.

311
00:19:53,880 --> 00:19:54,640
Afterward,

312
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:56,680
whether this succeeds or fails,

313
00:19:56,960 --> 00:19:57,920
it will

314
00:19:58,640 --> 00:20:00,970
have nothing to do with the Murong family.

315
00:20:09,720 --> 00:20:11,400
Miss Fang has made up her mind.

316
00:20:12,110 --> 00:20:12,880
Principal,

317
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:14,100
what about you?

318
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:15,770
This is no small matter.

319
00:20:16,030 --> 00:20:18,630
There's no guarantee
you won't be implicated.

320
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:21,530
We've come this far.

321
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:24,200
There's no point saying anything more.

322
00:20:30,110 --> 00:20:31,510
If she can survive,

323
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,160
get away safely,

324
00:20:33,830 --> 00:20:34,920
and from then on

325
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:37,000
stay away from Qingyi,

326
00:20:38,640 --> 00:20:39,750
I can try

327
00:20:40,110 --> 00:20:41,270
to pin this matter

328
00:20:41,720 --> 00:20:43,850
on the Li family's political enemies.

329
00:20:44,510 --> 00:20:45,750
Then I'll help her

330
00:20:46,030 --> 00:20:46,960
leave Nancheng.

331
00:20:48,960 --> 00:20:50,760
After all, Li Rongzhang has made

332
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:52,850
countless enemies over the years.

333
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:54,730
Plenty of people want him dead.

334
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:57,070
But for a stand-in,

335
00:20:57,640 --> 00:20:59,880
where can we find a suitable bride
to take her place

336
00:20:59,880 --> 00:21:01,940
and go through the ceremony with you?

337
00:21:35,110 --> 00:21:36,110
I knew it.

338
00:21:39,920 --> 00:21:41,110
A storybook happily-ever-after

339
00:21:41,110 --> 00:21:42,920
would never happen to me.

340
00:21:44,790 --> 00:21:46,320
Destroying the Huo family,

341
00:21:47,790 --> 00:21:49,270
avenging Xiaolan,

342
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:53,480
reuniting with an old friend...

343
00:21:55,310 --> 00:21:56,640
I wasn't clear-headed enough.

344
00:21:56,640 --> 00:21:57,720
Susu,

345
00:21:58,030 --> 00:21:59,270
it's those wicked people's fault,

346
00:21:59,270 --> 00:22:00,680
not yours.

347
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:03,130
Don't blame yourself for everything.

348
00:22:07,270 --> 00:22:08,530
The Fang family's ship

349
00:22:09,200 --> 00:22:10,930
was carrying normal supplies.

350
00:22:12,030 --> 00:22:13,640
Even a fuel leak

351
00:22:14,310 --> 00:22:17,370
couldn't possibly have
caused an explosion like that.

352
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:20,440
Word from Nanyang says

353
00:22:22,960 --> 00:22:24,070
Uncle Fang rushed to depart this time

354
00:22:24,070 --> 00:22:25,400
because he was

355
00:22:26,830 --> 00:22:30,230
transporting a batch of military supplies
for the Li family.

356
00:22:31,350 --> 00:22:32,270
You suspect

357
00:22:32,400 --> 00:22:34,200
that what happened to Uncle Fang

358
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:37,280
had something to do
with the Li family's shipment?

359
00:22:40,160 --> 00:22:42,220
Miss Fang, here's what you asked for.

360
00:22:43,110 --> 00:22:43,790
Thank you.

361
00:22:44,890 --> 00:22:45,500
[File]

362
00:22:45,730 --> 00:22:47,020
[Includes military/political officials
and civilians]

363
00:22:46,480 --> 00:22:47,640
I got the file

364
00:22:47,050 --> 00:22:49,200
[A total of 117 casualties]

365
00:22:47,640 --> 00:22:50,640
on the North-South Railway bombing case
12 years ago.

366
00:22:51,030 --> 00:22:53,540
It really does match
Murong Qingyu's account.

367
00:22:53,540 --> 00:22:54,740
[Investigation Record] [Crime Scene]

368
00:22:55,220 --> 00:22:57,690
[Military-grade RDX explosive]

369
00:22:56,550 --> 00:22:58,680
Both the explosion then and the one now

370
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:01,260
show traces of the same explosive

371
00:23:03,240 --> 00:23:05,510
Murong Qingyu mentioned—RDX.

372
00:23:08,550 --> 00:23:09,590
This explosion

373
00:23:11,510 --> 00:23:14,640
really seems like a repeat
of what happened 12 years ago.

374
00:23:17,510 --> 00:23:18,750
Ever since you told me

375
00:23:19,720 --> 00:23:21,580
that Li Rongzhang was involved in

376
00:23:22,310 --> 00:23:23,860
the North-South Railway bombing case...

377
00:23:23,860 --> 00:23:25,680
[Nancheng Station]

378
00:23:30,790 --> 00:23:33,400
I've dreamed every night of my brother

379
00:23:34,440 --> 00:23:35,920
weeping tears of blood.

380
00:23:38,830 --> 00:23:41,360
He's the reason
our families were destroyed.

381
00:23:43,680 --> 00:23:45,510
Now he's killed Uncle Fang.

382
00:23:47,590 --> 00:23:49,650
This grievance can never be settled.

383
00:23:51,440 --> 00:23:52,310
You and I...

384
00:23:53,790 --> 00:23:56,050
still have a long, difficult road ahead.

385
00:24:11,070 --> 00:24:13,000
I, Ren Susu, the adopted daughter,

386
00:24:13,030 --> 00:24:15,230
will never let my loved ones die in vain.

387
00:24:16,350 --> 00:24:17,680
I swear I'll...

388
00:24:24,830 --> 00:24:26,960
I'll get justice for every one of them.

389
00:24:42,030 --> 00:24:43,230
Young Master Qingyi,

390
00:24:43,440 --> 00:24:45,350
you're still recovering
from your injuries.

391
00:24:45,350 --> 00:24:47,350
You should've stayed
in Hangcheng a few more days.

392
00:24:47,350 --> 00:24:48,400
Why rush back?

393
00:24:49,030 --> 00:24:51,720
And you insisted that I drive
all the way here to pick you up.

394
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:55,450
I've been on the road for days
and haven't even had a chance to bathe.

395
00:24:56,400 --> 00:24:58,350
The Fang family just suffered a tragedy.

396
00:24:58,350 --> 00:24:59,590
She must be very sad.

397
00:25:00,480 --> 00:25:01,030
There it is.

398
00:25:01,030 --> 00:25:02,440
Still all for Miss Ren.

399
00:25:03,350 --> 00:25:05,480
The moment
you took over Master Huo's assets,

400
00:25:05,480 --> 00:25:06,830
you rushed to

401
00:25:06,830 --> 00:25:08,890
legitimize them through the market.

402
00:25:08,920 --> 00:25:09,880
After

403
00:25:10,200 --> 00:25:11,830
going through all that trouble,

404
00:25:11,830 --> 00:25:15,030
it turns out you were only doing it
to give them to Miss Ren.

405
00:25:16,510 --> 00:25:19,040
I have no use
for those shops and money anyway.

406
00:25:19,310 --> 00:25:20,350
But she

407
00:25:20,720 --> 00:25:22,000
can use the Huo family's money

408
00:25:22,000 --> 00:25:24,110
to compensate
all those girls who were harmed.

409
00:25:24,110 --> 00:25:25,910
That's putting it to proper use.

410
00:25:26,590 --> 00:25:27,350
Your betrothal gifts

411
00:25:27,350 --> 00:25:29,610
will definitely touch Miss Ren's heart.

412
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:34,140
Good things take time.

413
00:25:34,350 --> 00:25:37,080
You and Miss Ren are
finally going to be together.

414
00:25:46,310 --> 00:25:50,030
[Murong Residence]

415
00:26:13,720 --> 00:26:15,580
It just doesn't sit right with me.

416
00:26:17,920 --> 00:26:18,960
Some people

417
00:26:19,590 --> 00:26:21,830
are getting married
right after their father died—

418
00:26:21,830 --> 00:26:24,830
not mourning,
and not even wearing mourning clothes.

419
00:26:26,440 --> 00:26:27,750
Good heavens,

420
00:26:28,070 --> 00:26:29,680
truly no upbringing at all!

421
00:26:34,200 --> 00:26:34,960
First,

422
00:26:36,480 --> 00:26:37,400
my upbringing

423
00:26:38,400 --> 00:26:40,070
is not for a gossipmonger like you

424
00:26:40,070 --> 00:26:40,720
to judge.

425
00:26:41,240 --> 00:26:42,000
Second...

426
00:26:45,750 --> 00:26:47,110
whether I get married

427
00:26:47,310 --> 00:26:48,370
or how I get married

428
00:26:48,440 --> 00:26:51,000
is none of
my future sister-in-law's business.

429
00:26:51,000 --> 00:26:51,440
You...

430
00:26:51,550 --> 00:26:52,920
I only listen to Qingyu.

431
00:26:53,790 --> 00:26:54,400
You...

432
00:26:55,240 --> 00:26:56,680
Your family has fallen.

433
00:26:56,960 --> 00:26:59,090
How dare you act so arrogantly with me?

434
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:02,510
If it weren't for Qingyu
insisting on his own way,

435
00:27:02,510 --> 00:27:03,750
do you really think our family

436
00:27:03,750 --> 00:27:07,210
would accept a fallen-from-grace
daughter-in-law like you?

437
00:27:20,000 --> 00:27:20,640
Who is getting married?

438
00:27:20,640 --> 00:27:22,370
Y-Young Master Qingyi, hello.

439
00:27:22,830 --> 00:27:24,830
I'm asking you, who's getting married!

440
00:27:24,830 --> 00:27:26,760
Young Master Qingyu and Miss Fang.

441
00:27:28,070 --> 00:27:30,800
The wedding is
the day after tomorrow, the ninth.

442
00:27:40,200 --> 00:27:40,960
You're back!

443
00:27:41,880 --> 00:27:42,960
Quick, help me check it.

444
00:27:42,960 --> 00:27:45,240
-Is there something wrong with this gun?
-Get lost.

445
00:27:45,240 --> 00:27:45,680
You...

446
00:27:46,030 --> 00:27:46,750
How could you...

447
00:27:46,750 --> 00:27:47,880
I said, get lost!

448
00:27:49,830 --> 00:27:51,200
Don't try to scare me.

449
00:27:51,750 --> 00:27:53,200
I'm not afraid of you.

450
00:27:54,590 --> 00:27:55,350
Mother!

451
00:27:56,110 --> 00:27:56,830
Mother.

452
00:27:58,400 --> 00:27:59,310
Look at him.

453
00:28:12,140 --> 00:28:14,310
[Invitation] [Murong Qingyu] [Fang Mulan]

454
00:28:18,720 --> 00:28:19,690
[Invitation]

455
00:28:20,470 --> 00:28:24,460
[Murong Qingyu] [Fang Mulan]

456
00:28:26,270 --> 00:28:28,440
If I had come back a couple of days later,

457
00:28:28,440 --> 00:28:30,030
my dear brother and sister-in-law,

458
00:28:30,030 --> 00:28:32,160
would you two have already had a child?

459
00:28:39,720 --> 00:28:41,880
I've set aside a share of
the Huo family's assets for you.

460
00:28:41,880 --> 00:28:43,740
What exactly are you trying to do?

461
00:28:44,200 --> 00:28:44,880
You can tell me.

462
00:28:44,880 --> 00:28:45,550
I can help you,

463
00:28:45,550 --> 00:28:46,350
Ren Susu.

464
00:28:47,190 --> 00:28:48,970
♪ The more passionate ♪

465
00:28:49,110 --> 00:28:51,200
♪ Our past embrace ♪

466
00:28:50,640 --> 00:28:51,550
You can't.

467
00:28:53,910 --> 00:28:55,570
♪ The more icy ♪

468
00:28:55,680 --> 00:28:57,700
♪ Our present clash ♪

469
00:28:57,680 --> 00:28:59,590
You think that just because you swooped in
and grabbed the Huo family's assets

470
00:28:59,590 --> 00:29:02,380
♪ If not tangled in love ♪

471
00:29:01,000 --> 00:29:02,590
and gathered some scattered soldiers,

472
00:29:02,590 --> 00:29:05,320
♪ We are locked in hate ♪

473
00:29:04,070 --> 00:29:06,150
you can compete with the Murong family?

474
00:29:06,150 --> 00:29:10,800
♪ There is no escaping it ♪

475
00:29:07,680 --> 00:29:10,010
You don't even qualify to
sit at the table.

476
00:29:13,690 --> 00:29:15,520
♪ Sharper pain, deeper mark ♪

477
00:29:15,540 --> 00:29:17,870
♪ Deeper care, greater torment ♪

478
00:29:18,400 --> 00:29:20,290
Hasn't the Huo family
already been brought down?

479
00:29:20,290 --> 00:29:22,100
♪ I won't give up on you ♪

480
00:29:20,790 --> 00:29:22,130
Now that you've avenged
your greatest grievance,

481
00:29:22,130 --> 00:29:24,310
♪ Don't let go of me ♪

482
00:29:22,200 --> 00:29:23,160
why do you still...

483
00:29:23,160 --> 00:29:24,110
Avenged?

484
00:29:26,480 --> 00:29:28,920
♪ Let the ropes of fate ♪

485
00:29:28,950 --> 00:29:31,760
♪ Bind you and me ♪

486
00:29:29,590 --> 00:29:31,250
Now that Uncle Fang is dead...

487
00:29:32,750 --> 00:29:35,340
♪ Even if led to a precipice ♪

488
00:29:33,510 --> 00:29:35,360
I've lost the Fang family's backing.

489
00:29:35,360 --> 00:29:37,870
♪ Together, we fall ♪

490
00:29:36,590 --> 00:29:38,650
Of course, I can only hold onto Qingyu

491
00:29:38,920 --> 00:29:40,080
and the Murong family.

492
00:29:40,080 --> 00:29:41,570
♪ Must it take heartache ♪

493
00:29:41,590 --> 00:29:43,790
♪ To know my heart belongs to you? ♪

494
00:29:43,960 --> 00:29:44,750
Susu.

495
00:29:44,520 --> 00:29:46,690
♪ Hearts cold no more ♪

496
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:46,680
I know.

497
00:29:46,710 --> 00:29:48,240
♪ Is every sweet dream ♪

498
00:29:48,260 --> 00:29:50,510
♪ Destined to fade away? ♪

499
00:29:48,480 --> 00:29:50,030
You must have your reasons.

500
00:29:51,240 --> 00:29:53,190
♪ Don't let it end in smoke ♪

501
00:29:51,720 --> 00:29:53,110
But you can tell me.

502
00:29:53,380 --> 00:29:56,510
♪ Love and hate till the very end ♪

503
00:29:54,400 --> 00:29:56,400
I'll do everything I can to help you.

504
00:29:56,600 --> 00:29:59,110
♪ Hold nothing back ♪

505
00:29:57,270 --> 00:29:59,200
Why do you have to marry my brother?

506
00:29:59,240 --> 00:30:00,080
You're overthinking it.

507
00:30:00,080 --> 00:30:03,090
♪ Never back down, hold my ground ♪

508
00:30:03,240 --> 00:30:05,800
♪ Till I've given my all ♪

509
00:30:05,840 --> 00:30:06,790
♪ We ♪

510
00:30:07,940 --> 00:30:10,320
♪ Must be together ♪

511
00:30:10,810 --> 00:30:13,750
♪ Forevermore ♪

512
00:30:15,720 --> 00:30:18,320
Even if a broken clock
starts ticking again...

513
00:30:20,270 --> 00:30:22,870
it can never go back to
a moment that has passed.

514
00:30:27,240 --> 00:30:28,470
♪ We ♪

515
00:30:29,390 --> 00:30:31,740
♪ Remain bound by fate until the end ♪

516
00:30:32,330 --> 00:30:34,970
♪ Forevermore ♪

517
00:30:48,920 --> 00:30:51,720
♪ Neither you nor I ♪

518
00:30:53,660 --> 00:30:56,540
♪ Can ever break free ♪

519
00:31:02,400 --> 00:31:03,130
Let go of her!

520
00:31:03,880 --> 00:31:04,940
In broad daylight—

521
00:31:05,030 --> 00:31:06,760
have you no sense of propriety?

522
00:31:33,590 --> 00:31:34,920
You may have fooled Boze

523
00:31:35,680 --> 00:31:36,920
about Master Huo's death,

524
00:31:36,920 --> 00:31:38,120
but you can't fool me!

525
00:31:38,830 --> 00:31:41,270
Where are the Huo family's assets and men?

526
00:31:41,440 --> 00:31:42,160
Tell me!

527
00:31:45,240 --> 00:31:46,240
Just as I thought—

528
00:31:47,590 --> 00:31:50,310
once I took over Master Huo's network,

529
00:31:50,790 --> 00:31:52,200
you flew into a rage.

530
00:31:53,240 --> 00:31:54,030
What?

531
00:31:54,960 --> 00:31:56,830
Want me to hand them all over to you?

532
00:31:56,830 --> 00:31:57,640
What else?

533
00:31:58,830 --> 00:31:59,720
Remember this—

534
00:31:59,960 --> 00:32:02,820
everything about you
belongs to the Murong family.

535
00:32:02,960 --> 00:32:05,160
You can keep what the family gives you.

536
00:32:05,590 --> 00:32:06,640
But what we don't give you

537
00:32:06,640 --> 00:32:08,300
still entirely belongs to us!

538
00:32:17,030 --> 00:32:18,200
Dream on.

539
00:32:22,590 --> 00:32:24,000
Joking with you,

540
00:32:24,000 --> 00:32:25,460
showing you some respect,

541
00:32:26,640 --> 00:32:29,240
pretending to be
your dutiful son for a moment—

542
00:32:29,400 --> 00:32:31,200
and you actually got carried away with it?

543
00:32:31,200 --> 00:32:32,750
A dutiful son?

544
00:32:33,000 --> 00:32:34,000
As if you qualify!

545
00:32:35,240 --> 00:32:36,510
Why isn't your father

546
00:32:36,880 --> 00:32:38,680
in the family portrait outside?

547
00:32:38,830 --> 00:32:39,590
You know

548
00:32:40,200 --> 00:32:41,640
better than anyone

549
00:32:41,640 --> 00:32:43,100
who destroyed the family!

550
00:32:43,960 --> 00:32:45,160
No remorse,

551
00:32:46,270 --> 00:32:48,000
coveting what was never yours,

552
00:32:48,160 --> 00:32:49,890
defying your own birth mother—

553
00:32:50,640 --> 00:32:53,160
calling you an animal is already too kind.

554
00:32:54,510 --> 00:32:55,440
Animal?

555
00:32:56,960 --> 00:32:58,200
If I'm an animal,

556
00:32:58,750 --> 00:33:00,080
what does that make you?

557
00:33:01,920 --> 00:33:03,050
An animal's mother?

558
00:33:05,550 --> 00:33:06,880
Doesn't that make you an animal too?

559
00:33:06,880 --> 00:33:07,350
You...

560
00:33:12,720 --> 00:33:13,510
Qingyu!

561
00:33:16,200 --> 00:33:16,920
Mother,

562
00:33:17,720 --> 00:33:19,120
if you keep whipping him,

563
00:33:19,480 --> 00:33:20,510
he's going to die.

564
00:33:23,200 --> 00:33:24,070
Qingyu,

565
00:33:25,160 --> 00:33:26,820
you're still protecting him?

566
00:33:27,110 --> 00:33:27,790
Mother,

567
00:33:29,240 --> 00:33:30,900
if you really meant to kill me,

568
00:33:32,270 --> 00:33:34,510
you should've sent my brother away first.

569
00:33:34,510 --> 00:33:35,910
This eldest son of yours,

570
00:33:36,590 --> 00:33:38,000
so upright and noble,

571
00:33:38,790 --> 00:33:40,160
could never bear to
watch a son kill his mother

572
00:33:40,160 --> 00:33:41,490
or a mother kill her son.

573
00:33:44,510 --> 00:33:45,310
You wretch.

574
00:33:47,160 --> 00:33:48,550
From head to toe,

575
00:33:50,240 --> 00:33:52,920
you don't look like a Murong at all.

576
00:33:55,880 --> 00:33:57,720
How did I give birth to
such an animal as you?

577
00:33:57,720 --> 00:33:58,510
Cut the act.

578
00:33:59,350 --> 00:34:01,080
If my brother hadn't insisted,

579
00:34:01,590 --> 00:34:04,250
would I
even be in that family portrait outside?

580
00:34:05,590 --> 00:34:06,200
When did you ever

581
00:34:06,200 --> 00:34:08,199
treat me like a member of the family?

582
00:34:10,280 --> 00:34:12,480
You gave birth to me but never raised me.

583
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:14,699
You raised me, only to despise me.

584
00:34:14,710 --> 00:34:16,360
You despise me, yet still use me.

585
00:34:16,360 --> 00:34:18,150
And once I was
no longer of any use to you,

586
00:34:18,150 --> 00:34:19,280
you threw me away

587
00:34:19,510 --> 00:34:20,630
like trash!

588
00:34:21,150 --> 00:34:22,280
Do you really think

589
00:34:22,630 --> 00:34:24,690
the family name means anything to me?

590
00:34:28,320 --> 00:34:28,840
You...

591
00:34:29,030 --> 00:34:29,630
Auntie!

592
00:34:33,440 --> 00:34:35,639
Even a vicious tiger won't eat its cubs.

593
00:34:36,030 --> 00:34:36,710
Let go!

594
00:34:39,960 --> 00:34:41,440
Utterly shameless!

595
00:34:42,710 --> 00:34:44,230
In broad daylight,

596
00:34:44,480 --> 00:34:46,070
tangling with another man.

597
00:34:46,320 --> 00:34:48,230
Have you forgotten who you are now?

598
00:34:48,230 --> 00:34:49,760
You deserve a whipping too!

599
00:34:51,150 --> 00:34:51,710
Mother.

600
00:34:54,360 --> 00:34:55,070
Qingyi!

601
00:35:00,320 --> 00:35:02,520
Stop pretending to be the good guy here.

602
00:35:03,800 --> 00:35:05,330
Don't tell me you don't know

603
00:35:05,630 --> 00:35:06,960
how I feel about her.

604
00:35:07,920 --> 00:35:10,450
And yet you insist on
forcing her to marry you,

605
00:35:11,030 --> 00:35:13,230
all while claiming it's for my own good.

606
00:35:16,880 --> 00:35:17,880
This family...

607
00:35:21,670 --> 00:35:23,360
has never been my home!

608
00:35:24,440 --> 00:35:25,230
Somebody,

609
00:35:26,070 --> 00:35:27,550
throw this animal out!

610
00:35:28,280 --> 00:35:29,840
Since this isn't your home,

611
00:35:30,670 --> 00:35:33,110
go fend for yourself on the streets!

612
00:35:35,360 --> 00:35:36,070
Mother.

613
00:35:36,400 --> 00:35:37,530
I'll leave on my own!

614
00:36:00,400 --> 00:36:01,190
You said...

615
00:36:04,070 --> 00:36:05,800
you wanted me to leave with you.

616
00:36:10,960 --> 00:36:12,290
Let's go now, together,

617
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:14,150
okay?

618
00:36:16,180 --> 00:36:19,260
♪ This spark of wildfire
spreading across the plains ♪

619
00:36:19,830 --> 00:36:23,070
♪ Stirs embers that refuse to fade ♪

620
00:36:23,470 --> 00:36:26,890
♪ I seize fate by the hand ♪

621
00:36:26,910 --> 00:36:30,470
♪ Accusing it of refusing to relent ♪

622
00:36:30,740 --> 00:36:34,030
♪ Pain and joy blur before my eyes ♪

623
00:36:34,330 --> 00:36:37,860
♪ Fate keeps replaying its endless cycle ♪

624
00:36:36,920 --> 00:36:37,670
Let's go.

625
00:36:38,030 --> 00:36:43,510
♪ The love that refused to die ♪

626
00:36:44,820 --> 00:36:48,800
♪ Has already consumed us both ♪
